#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:192
#, no-c-format
msgid "Transactions and Splits"
msgstr "Transakcije i dijelovi"

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:195
#, no-c-format
msgid "Balanced transactions"
msgstr "Balansirane transakcije"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:197
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "As with GnuCash, data is entered in the form of transactions, each "
#| "generally consisting of 2 or more split entries. In fact, valid GnuCash "
#| "transactions will always contain at least 2 splits, and to conform to "
#| "GnuCash's double-entry bookkeeping standard, these must be in monetary "
#| "balance (i.e., they must balance out to zero). &kappname; encourages, but "
#| "does not enforce, this standard, but any imported transaction which is "
#| "not balanced will be marked in the ledger view as having a problem."
msgid ""
"As with &gnucash;, data is entered in the form of transactions, each "
"generally consisting of 2 or more split entries. In fact, valid &gnucash; "
"transactions will always contain at least 2 splits, and to conform to "
"&gnucash;'s double-entry bookkeeping standard, these must be in monetary "
"balance (&ie;, they must balance out to zero). &kmymoney; encourages, but "
"does not enforce, this standard, but any imported transaction which is not "
"balanced will be marked in the ledger view as having a problem."
msgstr ""
"U GnuCash-u podaci se unose u formi transakcije, svaka se generalno sastoji "
"od dva ili vise odvojenih unosa. Ustvari, validna GnuCash transakcija će "
"uvijek sadržavati bar dva dijela, i da bise podudaralo sa GnuCash dupli-unos "
"standardom održavanja knjiga, moraju biti monetarno uravnotežene (npr., "
"njihov bilans mora biti jednak nuli). &kappname; ohrabruje, ali ne "
"primorava, ovaj standard, ali svaka transakcija koja nije izbalansirana će "
"biti označena da ima problem u glavnom pregledu."

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:209
#, no-c-format
msgid "Payees"
msgstr "Primatelji uplata"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:211
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&kappname; prefers that all transactions have a Payee (a generic term "
#| "that encompasses both payees and payers), and unlike GnuCash, a list of "
#| "these payees is maintained. Payee names are generated by the importer "
#| "from the GnuCash transaction's Description field."
msgid ""
"&kmymoney; prefers that all transactions have a Payee (a generic term that "
"encompasses both payees and payers), and unlike &gnucash;, a list of these "
"Payees is maintained. Payee names are generated by the importer from the "
"&gnucash; transaction's Description field."
msgstr ""
"&kappname; preferira da sve transakcije imaju Klijente (generički termin "
"koji označava i primaoca i izvršitelja uplate) i za razliku od GnuCash-a, "
"lista primatelja uplate se održava. Njihova imena su generisana od strane "
"importera iz GnuCash opisnog polja transakcije."

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:220
#, no-c-format
msgid "Transfers"
msgstr "Transferi"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:222
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&kappname; uses the term Transfer to describe a transaction which does "
#| "not involve a Category, but only transfers money between Asset and/or "
#| "Liability accounts."
msgid ""
"&kmymoney; uses the term Transfer to describe a transaction which does not "
"involve a Category, but only transfers money between Asset and/or Liability "
"accounts."
msgstr ""
"&kappname; koristi termin Transfer da opise transakcije koje ne uključuju "
"kategorije, ali samo prenose novac između Asset i/ili Liability računa."

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:230
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reconcile"
msgstr "Uskladi"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:232
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&kappname; provides an account reconciliation function similar to that of "
#| "GnuCash, and the corresponding transaction status will be imported."
msgid ""
"&kmymoney; provides an account reconciliation function similar to that of "
"&gnucash;, and the corresponding transaction status will be imported."
msgstr ""
"&kappname; pruža usklađivanje računa slično onome u GnuCash-u te se "
"odgovarajući status transakcije unosi."

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid "Commodities"
msgstr "Imovina"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:242
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "GnuCash uses the term Commodity to cover both currencies and non-currency "
#| "assets. These are treated separately in &kappname;."
msgid ""
"&gnucash; uses the term Commodity to cover both currencies and non-currency "
"assets. These are treated separately in &kmymoney;."
msgstr ""
"GnuCash koristi termin Commodity da pokrije i valute i imovinu bez valute. "
"Oni se posmatraju odvojeno u &kappname;."

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:248
#, no-c-format
msgid "Currencies"
msgstr "Valute"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:250
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&kappname; has built-in support for all foreign <link linkend=\"details."
#| "currencies\">currency</link> types. &kappname; also requires that the "
#| "user specify a base currency, this being the default currency for new "
#| "accounts. The importer will attempt to determine the most likely base "
#| "currency, though this choice may be rejected in favor of an alternative."
msgid ""
"&kmymoney; has built-in support for all foreign <link linkend=\"details."
"currencies\">currency</link> types. &kmymoney; also requires that the user "
"specify a base currency, this being the default currency for new accounts. "
"The importer will attempt to determine the most likely base currency, though "
"this choice may be rejected in favor of an alternative."
msgstr ""
"&kappname; ima ugrađenu podršku za sve strane tipove <link linkend=\"details."
"currencies\">valuta</link>. &kappname; također zahtijeva da korisnik "
"specificira baznu valutu, koja će biti unaprijed definisana valuta za sve "
"nove račune. Importer će pokušati da odredi najvjerovatniju baznu valutu, "
"iako se ta preporuka može zamijeniti nekom željenom valutom."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:259
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "(NOTE: &kappname; does not currently support accounts denominated in "
#| "'defunct' currencies (except those replaced by the Euro). At present, it "
#| "will be necessary to remove any such accounts from your GnuCash file "
#| "before importing. We hope to improve on this situation in a future "
#| "release.)"
msgid ""
"&kmymoney; does not currently support accounts denominated in 'defunct' "
"currencies (except those replaced by the Euro). At present, it will be "
"necessary to remove any such accounts from your &gnucash; file before "
"importing. We hope to improve on this situation in a future release."
msgstr ""
"(BILJEŠKA: &kappname; trenutno ne podržava račune označene sa 'defunct' "
"valutama (osim onih zamijenjenih Eurom). Trenutno, potrebno je da uklonite "
"sve takve račune iz svoje GuCash datoteke prije unosa. Nadamo se da ćemo "
"unaprijediti ponašanje pri ovakvim situacijama u budućnosti.)"

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:268
#, no-c-format
msgid "Securities and Investments"
msgstr "Sigurnosti i investicije"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:270
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Non-currency assets (normally stocks and bonds) are called Securities by "
#| "&kappname;, and represent the main difference between the two products, "
#| "in that &kappname; requires any account denominated in a security to be "
#| "subordinate to an Investment Account. This is described in more detail in "
#| "the chapter on <link linkend=\"details.investments\">Investments</link>. "
#| "Though users may have implemented such a relationship, GnuCash imposes no "
#| "defined structure on it, so the importer is unable to detect it and "
#| "perform an automatic conversion. Three options are therefore made "
#| "available:"
msgid ""
"Non-currency assets (normally stocks and bonds) are called Securities by "
"&kmymoney;, and represent the main difference between the two products, in "
"that &kmymoney; requires any account denominated in a security to be "
"subordinate to an Investment Account. This is described in more detail in "
"the chapter on <link linkend=\"details.investments\">Investments</link>. "
"Though users may have implemented such a relationship, &gnucash; imposes no "
"defined structure on it, so the importer is unable to detect it and perform "
"an automatic conversion. Three options are therefore made available:"
msgstr ""
"Imovina bez valute (uobičajeno dionice i obveznice) se nazivaju sigurnostima "
"u &kappname;, i predstavljaju glavnu razliku između dva proizvoda, "
"&kappname; zahtijeva da svaki račun bude obilježen kao sigutnost kako bi bio "
"podređen investicionom računu. Ovo je detaljnije opisano u poglavlju <link "
"linkend=\"details.investments\">Investicije</link>. Iako korisnici "
"implementiraju takve odnose, GnuCash ne definiše nikakvu strukturu za "
"navedeno, tako da importer inje u mogućnosti da ih prepozna i izvrši "
"automatsku konverziju. Zbog toga su omogućene tri opcije:"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:283
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Create a separate Investment account for each security, with the same name "
"as the security"
msgstr ""
"Napravite posebno investicioni račun za svaku sigurnost, sa istim imenom kao "
"sigurnost"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:288
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Create a single Investment account which will act as 'parent' for all "
"security accounts"
msgstr ""
"Napravite samo jedan investicioni račun koji će predstavljati 'roditelja' za "
"sve sigurnosne račune"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:293
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Create several Investment accounts, and assign securities to them as "
"directed by the user."
msgstr ""
"Napravite više investicionih računa i dodijelite im sigurnosti kako korisnik "
"odabere."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:298
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "It depends entirely on user requirements which of these options is "
#| "relevant in each situation, and in some cases, manual restructuring of "
#| "accounts after importation may be necessary."
msgid ""
"User requirements and preferences determine which of these options is "
"relevant in each situation, and in some cases, manual restructuring of "
"accounts after import may be necessary."
msgstr ""
"Potpuno ovisi od korisničkih zahtijeva koja od ovih opcija je važa u svakoj "
"akciji i u nekim slučajevima, ručno rekonstruisanje računa nakon "
"implementacije će biti potreno."

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:306
#, no-c-format
msgid "Prices and currency rates"
msgstr "Cijene i valute"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:308
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Security prices and currency exchange rates as displayed in the GnuCash "
#| "Price Editor will be imported. In addition, price and rate entries will "
#| "be generated from all transactions involving securities and multiple "
#| "currencies."
msgid ""
"Security prices and currency exchange rates as displayed in the &gnucash; "
"Price Editor will be imported. In addition, price and rate entries will be "
"generated from all transactions involving securities and multiple currencies."
msgstr ""
"Cijene sigurnosti i razmjena valuta prikazana u GnuCash editoru cijena će "
"biti unesena. Naknadno, cijena i valute će biti generisane za sve "
"transakcije uključujući sigurnosti i višestruke valute."

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:316 details-impexp.docbook:441
#, no-c-format
msgid "Online Quotes"
msgstr "Internet navodi"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:318
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "For obtaining online price and currency rate quotations, GnuCash uses a "
#| "package called Finance::Quote. Recent versions of &kappname; contain "
#| "support for this package for obtaining stock quotes, and this will be "
#| "used by default when importing data. You may however select to convert to "
#| "the native method used by &kappname; which is covered in more detail in "
#| "<link linkend=\"details.investments.onlinequotes\">online quotes</link>."
msgid ""
"For obtaining online price and currency rate quotations, &gnucash; uses a "
"perl package called <literal>Finance::Quote</literal>. &kmymoney; contain "
"support for this package for obtaining stock quotes, and this will be used "
"by default when importing data. You may however select to convert to the "
"native method used by &kmymoney; which is covered in more detail in <link "
"linkend=\"details.investments.onlinequotes\">online quotes</link>."
msgstr ""
"Za pristupanje online navodima cijena i valuta, GnuCash koristi paket nazvan "
"Finance::Quote. Prethodne verzije &kappname;-a sadrže podršku ovog paketa "
"kako bi dobile navode za dionice, i to se koristi kao unaprijed definisano "
"prilikom unosa podataka. Vi također možete odabrati da se prebacite na "
"unaprijed definisanu metodu koju koristi sam &kappname; što je detaljnije "
"opisanu na <link linkend=\"details.investments.onlinequotes\">online navodi</"
"link>."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:327
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you choose to do so, the following dialog will allow selection of a "
#| "'native' &kappname; price source, or a user-defined source, for each "
#| "account for which online quotes are required. However, the stock (ticker) "
#| "symbol will be imported unchanged. Since this symbol will almost "
#| "certainly be different in the two packages, it will need to be manually "
#| "edited after completion of the import process. Future currency rate "
#| "updates will not use Finance::Quote, and will always use the native "
#| "retrieval method."
msgid ""
"If you choose to do so, the following dialog will allow selection of a "
"'native' &kmymoney; price source, or a user-defined source, for each account "
"for which online quotes are required. However, the stock (ticker) symbol "
"will be imported unchanged. Since this symbol may be different in the two "
"packages, it will need to be manually edited after completion of the import "
"process. Future currency rate updates will not use <literal>Finance::Quote</"
"literal>, and will always use the native retrieval method."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko se odlucite da tako uradite, sljedeći dijalog će dozvoliti odabir "
"'native' (urođenog) &kappname; izvora cijena, ili izvora definisanog od "
"strane korisnika, za svaki račun za koji su online navodi potrebni. Ipak, "
"simbol za dionicu će biti unesen nepromijenjen. Pošto će ovaj simbol sasvim "
"sigurno biti drugačiji u dva paketa, mora se ručno editovati nakon završetka "
"procesa unosa. Buduće promjene odnosa valuta neće koristiti Finance::Quote i "
"uvijek će koristiti urođenu metodu za pronalaženje."

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:350 details-impexp.docbook:454
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scheduled Transactions"
msgstr "Planirane transakcije"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:352
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&kappname; does not retain the separation made in GnuCash between "
#| "template transactions and their frequency of occurrence. Transaction data "
#| "will be duplicated if the same template is used in different schedules, "
#| "but this is not likely to be of great significance."
msgid ""
"&kmymoney; does not retain the separation made in &gnucash; between template "
"transactions and their frequency of occurrence. Transaction data will be "
"duplicated if the same template is used in different schedules, but this is "
"not likely to be of great significance."
msgstr ""
"&kappname; ne zadržava razdvajanje šablonskih transakcija i učestalosti "
"njihovih pojavljivanja napravljeno u GnuCash-u. Podaci transakcije će se "
"duplicirati ukoliko se isti šablon koristi u različitim rasporedima, mada "
"ovo nije od velikog značaja."

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:360
#, no-c-format
msgid "Schedule types"
msgstr "Tipovi rasporeda"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:362
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&kappname; classifies all schedules as one of three types, Bills, "
#| "Deposits, or Transfers. Since GnuCash does not make such a distinction, "
#| "the importer attempts to determine the classification from the accounts "
#| "and direction of money movements. It may be that in some cases incorrect "
#| "assumptions are made, and these will need manual correction."
msgid ""
"&kmymoney; classifies all schedules as one of three types: Bills, Deposits, "
"or Transfers. Since &gnucash; does not make such a distinction, the importer "
"attempts to determine the classification from the accounts and direction of "
"money movements. It may be that in some cases incorrect assumptions are "
"made, and these will need manual correction."
msgstr ""
"&kappname; klasificira sve rasporede kao jedan od sljedeća tri tipa, Računi, "
"Depoziti ili Transferi. Pošto GnuCash ne pravi takvu razliku, "
"importeropokušava da odredi klasifikaciju iz računa i smjera u kojem se "
"novac kreće. Može se desiti da u nekim slučajevima pogrešne pretpostavke "
"budu donesene, i one će zahtijevati ručnu prepravku."

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:372
#, no-c-format
msgid "Suspect Schedules"
msgstr "Sumnjičavi rasporedi"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:374
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Some features of GnuCash scheduled transactions are not available in "
#| "&kappname;, so the importer tries in each case to reach a reasonable "
#| "compromise in converting the data. These transactions will be flagged as "
#| "suspect, and the user will be given the option of editing them directly "
#| "during the import process. Examples of situations which may cause this "
#| "are:"
msgid ""
"Some features of &gnucash; scheduled transactions are not available in "
"&kmymoney;, so the importer tries in each case to reach a reasonable "
"compromise in converting the data. These transactions will be flagged as "
"suspect, and the user will be given the option of editing them directly "
"during the import process. Examples of situations which may cause this are:"
msgstr ""
"Neke opcije GnuCash planiranih transakcija nisu omogućene u &kappname;, pa "
"importer u takvim slučajevima pokušava da dođe do razumnog kompromisa pri "
"konvertovanju podataka. Ove transakcije će biti obilježene kao sumnjičave i "
"korisnik će imati opciju da ih edituje direktno tokom procesa unosa. "
"Primjeri situacija koje mogu nešto ovakvo prouzrokovati su:"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:384
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "some frequency intervals supported in GnuCash are not currently available "
#| "in &kappname;"
msgid ""
"some frequency intervals supported in &gnucash; are not currently available "
"in &kmymoney;"
msgstr ""
"neki intervali pojavljivanja podržani u GnuCash-u trenutno nisu mogući u "
"&kappname;"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:389
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&kappname; does not support the use of formulae and variables in amount "
#| "fields"
msgid ""
"&kmymoney; does not support the use of formulae and variables in amount "
"fields"
msgstr ""
"&kappname; ne podržava upotrebu formula i varijabli u poljima za vrijednost"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:394
#, no-c-format
msgid "complex cases which have not yet been identified for import."
msgstr "kompleksni slučajevi unosa još nisu identifikovani."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:398
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Despite best efforts, it is possible that, due to the many options "
#| "involved, a scheduled transaction may cause a fatal error within "
#| "&kappname;. If this sort of problem seems to be occurring, the importer "
#| "offers the option to drop all suspect schedules."
msgid ""
"Despite best efforts, it is possible that, due to the many options involved, "
"a scheduled transaction may cause a fatal error within &kmymoney;. If this "
"sort of problem seems to be occurring, the importer offers the option to "
"drop all suspect schedules."
msgstr ""
"Uprkos najboljim naporima, moguće je da, zbog mnoštva omogućenih opcija, "
"planirana transakcija dovede do fatalne greške &kappname;. Ukoliko dođe do "
"ovakvog problema, importer nudi opciju da se riješite svih sumnjičavih "
"transakcija."

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:408
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reports"
msgstr "Izvještaji"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:410
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&kappname; provides a comprehensive selection of configurable reports, "
#| "described in more detail in <link linkend=\"details.reports\">Reports.</"
#| "link> These will not necessarily, however, match precisely those reports "
#| "available in GnuCash."
msgid ""
"&kmymoney; provides a comprehensive selection of configurable reports, "
"described in more detail in <link linkend=\"details.reports\">Reports.</"
"link> These will not necessarily, however, match precisely those reports "
"available in &gnucash;."
msgstr ""
"&kappname; pruža obiman izbor podesivih izvještaja, koji su detaljnije "
"opisani na <link linkend=\"details.reports\">Izvještaji.</link> Ipak, ovi "
"neće tačno odgovarati onim izvještajima dostupnim u GnuCash-u."

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:420
#, no-c-format
msgid "Selecting Importer Options"
msgstr "Odabir opcija importera"

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:433
#, no-c-format
