#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"See <link linkend=\"gncsecurities\">\"Securities and Investments\"</link> "
"above."
msgstr ""
"Pogledajte <link linkend=\"gncsecurities\">\"Osiguranja i investicije\"</"
"link> iznad."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:443
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turn this off if you wish to use the native method for future online price "
"quotes."
msgstr ""
"Ugasite ovo ukoliko želite da koristite urođene metode za buduće online "
