#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:547
#, no-c-format
msgid "QIF Importer"
msgstr "QIF uvoznik"

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:550
#, no-c-format
msgid "QIF format considered harmful"
msgstr "QIF format se smatra štetnim"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:552
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Generally speaking, the QIF format should be avoided wherever possible. It "
"is a poor choice for transporting financial data. Among other things, QIF "
"suffers from these problems:"
msgstr ""
"Generalno govoreći, QIF format bi se trebao izbjegavati kada god je to "
"moguće. To je loš odabir za prenos finansijskih podataka. Između ostalog, "
"problemi sa QIF formatom su sljedeći:"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:560
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Lack of standardized format: Different versions of the same program will "
"impart different meanings to the same element."
msgstr ""
"Manjak standardizovang formata: Različite verzije istog programa će dati "
"drugačije značenje istim elementima."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:565
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Lack of transaction identifier: Because there is no ID number associated "
"with each transaction, matching duplicate transactions is haphazard at best."
msgstr ""
"Manjak identifikacije transakcija: Pošto nema ID broja povezanog sa svakom "
"transakcijom, slučajno povezivanje dupliciranih transakcija je ono što će se "
"dogoditi u najboljem slučaju."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:571
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Lack of expressiveness: The grammar is really simple, and cannot portray the "
"depth of financial information found in today's financial environment."
msgstr ""
"Manjak izražajnosti: Gramatika je vrlo jednostavna i ne može prikazati "
"dubinu finansijskih indformacija koje se danas pronalate u finansijskim "
"okruženjima."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:577
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "This is generally why Intuit stopped supporting QIF input at all with "
#| "Quicken 2005. If you have the option of getting data some other way, like "
#| "OFX, always choose that option."
msgid ""
"This is generally why Intuit stopped supporting QIF input at all with "
"<application>Quicken</application> 2005. If you have the option of getting "
"data some other way, like OFX, always choose that option."
msgstr ""
"Ovo su samo neke od mnoštva stvari zbog kojih je Intuit prestao podržavati "
"QIF input u potpunosti sa Quicken 2005. Ukoliko imate opciju da podatke "
"dobijete naneki drugi način, kao što je OFX, uvijek odaberite tu opciju."

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:585
#, no-c-format
msgid "How to import a QIF file"
msgstr "Kako unijeti QIF datoteku"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:587
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "To import a QIF file, first ensure you have a valid &kappname; file open. "
#| "Then select <menuchoice><guimenuitem>Import</guimenuitem> "
#| "<guimenuitem>QIF...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> from the <guimenu>File</"
#| "guimenu> menu."
msgid ""
"To import a QIF file, first ensure you have a valid &kmymoney; file open. "
"Then select <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guisubmenu>Import</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>QIF...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> menu item."
msgstr ""
"Da biste unijeli QIF datoteku, prvo se pobrinite da imate validnu &kappname; "
"datoteku otvorenu. Zatim odaberite <menuchoice><guimenuitem>Import</"
"guimenuitem> <guimenuitem>QIF...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> iz "
"<guimenu>File</guimenu>  menija."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:603
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The resulting dialog prompts for the QIF filename allowing you to locate "
#| "the file by clicking on the <guibutton>Browse</guibutton> button."
msgid ""
"The resulting dialog prompts for the QIF filename, allowing you to locate "
"the file by clicking on the <guibutton>Browse</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Rezultujući dijalog se prikazuje, te vam omogućava da locirate svoju "
"datoteku klikom na <guibutton>Browse</guibutton> dugme."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:608
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Also, &kappname; differentiates between the import of a bank statement "
#| "file and historic data exported from another application. The default is "
#| "to import a bank statement file. In case you are importing data from your "
#| "previous personal finance manager application select the appropriate "
#| "option."
msgid ""
"&kmymoney; differentiates between the import of a bank statement file and "
"historic data exported from another application. The default is to import a "
"bank statement file. In case you are importing data from your previous "
"personal finance manager application select the appropriate option."
msgstr ""
"Također, &kappname; razlikuje unos datoteke izjave banke i historijskih "
"podataka eksportovanih iz neke druge aplikacije. Unaprijed definisano je da "
"se unese datoteka izvoda banke. U slučaju da unosite podatke iz prošle "
"privatne finansijsko menadžerske aplikacije, odaberite odgovarajuću opciju."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:615
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In general the default QIF profile should work with your QIF data. In some "
"cases it might become necessary to use a modified QIF profile. See the <link "
"linkend=\"details.impexp.qifimp.profile\">next section</link> for more "
"details on that subject."
msgstr ""
"Uobičajeni QIF profil bi u većini slučajeva trebao raditi sa vašim QIF "
"podacima. U nekim slučajevima moguće je da ćete morati koristiti "
"modificirani QIF profil. Pogledajte <link linkend=\"details.impexp.qifimp."
"profile\">sljedeću sekciju</link> za više detalja na ovu temu."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:622
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click on <guibutton>Import</guibutton> to import the QIF file."
msgstr "Kliknite na <guibutton>Uvoz</guibutton> da uvezete QIF datoteku."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:626
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&kappname; will start scanning the file to determine the formats used to "
#| "represent dates and numbers. In case it cannot determine a date format "
#| "unambiguously, &kappname; will ask the user to select one from the list "
#| "of possible date formats."
msgid ""
"&kmymoney; will start scanning the file to determine the formats used to "
"represent dates and numbers. In case it cannot determine a date format "
"unambiguously, &kmymoney; will ask the user to select one from the list of "
"possible date formats."
msgstr ""
"&kappname; će početi sa skeniranjem datoteke da odredi formate korištene za "
"datume i brojeve. U slučaju da ne može odrediti format datuma nedvosmisleno, "
"&kappname; će pitati korisnika da odabere jedan iz liste ponuđenih formata "
"podataka."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:633
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Next, &kappname; imports the data and creates all necessary objects, such "
#| "as payee information, accounts and category records, and stock price "
#| "information. Wherever possible, existing transactions will be matched "
#| "against the imported information. A progress bar is shown and updated "
#| "during the import process."
msgid ""
"Next, &kmymoney; imports the data and creates all necessary objects, such as "
"Payees, Accounts, Categories, and stock price information. Wherever "
"possible, existing transactions will be matched against the imported "
"information. A progress bar is shown and updated during the import process."
msgstr ""
"Zatim, &kappname; unosi podatke i kreira sve potrebne objekte, kao što su "
"informacije o osobi koja vrši transakcije, računi i zapisi kategorija i "
"informacije o cijenama dionica. Gdjegod je to moguće, postojeće transakcije "
"će se povezati sa unesenim informacijama. \n"
"Bar koji označava dokle je proces došao će biti prikazan i mijenjaće se kako "
"proces bude odmicao."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:640
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "In case &kappname; could not detect the name of the account to be "
#| "imported, the user will be asked to select the account into which the "
#| "data should be imported. If the account does not already exist in your "
#| "file, a new account can be created by clicking on <guibutton>Create</"
#| "guibutton>."
msgid ""
"In case &kmymoney; cannot detect the name of the account to be imported, the "
"user will be asked to select the account into which the data should be "
"imported. If the account does not already exist in your file, a new account "
"can be created by clicking the <guibutton>Create</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"U slučaju da &kappname; ne može prepoznati ime računa koji se unosi, "
"korisnik će morati odabrati račun u koji se podaci unose. Ukoliko račun ne "
"postoji, novi račun će biti kreiran klikom na <guibutton>Create</guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:647
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "At the end of the import, &kappname; shows a statement import statistics "
#| "window."
msgid ""
"At the end of the import, &kmymoney; shows a statement import statistics "
"window."
msgstr ""
"Na kraju unosa, &kappname; prikazuje prozor u kojem se prikazuje statistika "
"unosa."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: details-impexp.docbook:654
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Statement statistics</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Statistika izjava</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-impexp.docbook:660
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>Statement statistics</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>Statistika izjava</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:666
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "After importing, all of the imported transactions will be shown with a "
#| "yellow background in the ledger view. In case &kappname; was able to "
#| "match an imported transaction with an already existing transaction, the "
#| "background is shown in light green."
msgid ""
"After importing, all of the imported transactions will be shown in the "
"ledger view with a yellow background. In case &kmymoney; was able to match "
"an imported transaction with an already existing transaction, the background "
"is shown in light green."
msgstr ""
"Nakon unosa, sve unesene transakcije će biti prikazane na žutoj pozadini u "
"glavnom pregledu. U slučaju da  je &kappname; bio u mogućnosti da poveže "
"unesenu transakciju sa već postojećom transakcijom, pozadina će se "
"prmijeniti u svijetlo zelenu."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:673
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The next step is to verify the imported data and accept it. This is a "
#| "general process and also applies to imports from other sources. It is "
#| "outlined in a separate section of this document."
msgid ""
"The next step is to verify the imported data and accept it. This is a "
"general process and also applies to imports from other sources. It is "
"outlined in a separate section of this document. JHOXXXJHO"
msgstr ""
"Sljedeći korak je da verifikujete unesene podatke i da ih prihvatite. Ovo je "
"generalni proces i odnosi se i na unossa ostalih izvora. Prikazano je u "
"odvojenoj sekciji ovog dokumenta."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:680
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The colors used to mark imported and matched transactions are customizable "
"and may be different in your environment."
msgstr ""
"Boje upotrijebljene za označavanje unesenih i povezanih transakcija su "
"podesive i mogu biti drugačije u vašem okruženju."

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:731
#, no-c-format
msgid "Setting up a QIF profile"
msgstr "Pravljenje QIF profila"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:733
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Because there is no universally standard format for a QIF file, different "
#| "vendors have taken liberties with the format, and introduced their own "
#| "nuances. The QIF Profile allows &kappname; to know about the "
#| "peculiarities of your file. To edit an existing QIF Profile, or to create "
#| "a new one, press the <guibutton>New</guibutton> button on the QIF Import "
#| "dialog, near the profile selector."
msgid ""
"Because there is no universally standard format for a QIF file, different "
"vendors have taken liberties with the format, and introduced their own "
"nuances. The QIF Profile allows &kmymoney; to know about the peculiarities "
"of your file. To edit an existing QIF Profile, use the various fields on the "
"QIF Import dialog. To create a new one, press the <guibutton>New</guibutton> "
"button near the profile selector."
msgstr ""
"Pošto ne postoji univerzalni standardni format za QIF datoteku, različiti "
"prodavači su uzeli za slobodu ovaj format, te su u njega ubacili neke svoje "
"nijanse. QIF Profil omogućava &kappname; da zna sve o osobenostima vaše "
"datoteke. Da editujete postojeći QIF Profil, ili da napravite novi, "
"pritisnite <guibutton>New</guibutton> dugme na QIF Import dijalogu, pored "
"selektora profila."

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-impexp.docbook:749
#, no-c-format
msgid "QIF Profile Editor"
msgstr "Uređivač QIF Profila"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:756
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Previous versions of &kappname; used to have a tab for date and amount "
#| "specifications. &kappname; now determines those settings by scanning the "
#| "file. If it cannot figure out all settings, it will interrogate the user "
#| "during import."
msgid ""
"Recent versions of &kmymoney; no longer have tabs for date and amount "
"specifications. &kmymoney; now determines those settings by scanning the "
"file. If it cannot figure out all settings, it will interrogate the user "
"during import."
msgstr ""
"Prethodne verzije &kappname; su imale tab za specifikacije datume i iznosa. "
"&kappname; sada određuje te postavke pri skeniranju datoteke. Ukoliko ne "
"može ustanoviti sve psotavke, komuniciraće sa korisnikom prilikom unosa."

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:805
#, no-c-format
msgid "Transaction matching"
msgstr "Povezivanje transakcija"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:807
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "As noted previously, one of the major drawbacks of the QIF format is the "
#| "lack of a unique identifier for each transaction. Thus, if you import a "
#| "QIF file and some of the transactions are already in your ledger, you may "
#| "get duplicates. &kappname; attempts to get around this by looking for "
#| "transactions that look similar to those you already have. If it finds "
#| "something that looks like the same transaction, it will match the "
#| "apparent duplicate."
msgid ""
"As noted previously, one of the major drawbacks of the QIF format is the "
"lack of a unique identifier for each transaction. Thus, if you import a QIF "
"file and some of the transactions are already in your ledger, you may get "
"duplicates. &kmymoney; attempts to get around this by looking for existing "
"transactions that look similar to the one being imported. If it finds "
"something that looks like the same transaction, it will match the apparent "
"duplicate."
msgstr ""
"Kao što je zabilježeno prije, jedna od najvećih mana QIF formata je manjak "
"jedinstvene identifikacije za svaku transakciju. Zbog toga, ukoliko unesete "
"QIF datoteku i neke od transakcija se ceć nalaze u sistemu, možete dobiti "
"duplikate. &kappname; pokušava da zaobiđe ovo tako što traži transakcije "
"slične onim koje su već prisutne. Ukoliko pronađe nešto što izgleda da je "
"ista transakcija, povezaće je sa očigledim duplikatom."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:817
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This can be a problem if you have transactions that look too similar but are "
"actually different. In this case, you can unmatch those transactions later "
"in the ledger view."
msgstr ""
"Ovo može biti problem ukoliko imate transakcije koje izgledaju veoma slično, "
"ali su ustvari različite. U tom slučaju, možete razdvojiti te transakcije "
"kasnije u glavnom pregledu."

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:825
#, no-c-format
msgid "Writing an import filter"
msgstr "Pisanje filtera importera"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:827
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Sometimes you may have data in a custom format, like comma-separated-"
#| "values (CSV) or something else unique to your situation. As of version "
#| "4.6, &kappname; includes a CSV Importer Plugin, but you can still import "
#| "other types of files into &kappname; using a QIF Import Filter. A filter "
#| "is a custom program you write which takes your special file as input, and "
#| "produces a QIF file as output. This can be a shell script, a perl script, "
#| "a compiled program written in C/C++, or anything else you can dream of, "
#| "as long as the system can run it."
msgid ""
"Sometimes you may have data in a custom format, like comma-separated-values "
"(CSV) or something else unique to your situation. As of version 4.6, "
"&kmymoney; includes a CSV Importer Plugin, but you can still import other "
"types of files into &kmymoney; using a QIF Import Filter. A filter is a "
"custom program you write which takes your special file as input, and "
"produces a QIF file as output. This can be a shell script, a perl script, a "
"compiled program written in C/C++, or anything else you can dream of, as "
"long as the system can run it."
msgstr ""
"Ponekad možete imati podatke u nekom vlastitom formatu, kao što je "
"CSV(vrijednosti razdvojene zarezom) ili nekom drugom jedinstvenom za vašu "
"situaciju. Od verzije 4.6, &kappname; uključuje CSV importer dodatak, ali vi "
"i dalje možete unijeti ostale tipove datoteka u &kappname; koristeći QIF "
"uvozni filter. Filter je modifikovani program koji vi pišete, koji uzima "
"vašu posebnu datoteku za unos, i proizvodi QIF datoteku. Ovo može iti shell "
"script, perl script, kompajlirani program napisan u C/C++, ili bilo šta "
"drugo što možete zamisliti, sve dok ga sistem može pokrenuti."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:838
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To use it, edit your favorite QIF Profile, and select the Filter tab. Enter "
"the location of your filter program where prompted. Then, whenever you do a "
"QIF import using this profile, the file you select for importing will be run "
"through your filter first."
msgstr ""
"Da biste ga koristli, editujte svoj omiljeni QIF Profil i odaberite Filter "
"tab. Unesite lokaciju vašeg filter programa gdje bude tražena. Ubuduće, kada "
"god budete koristili QIF import za unos pomoću ovog profila, datoteka koju "
"odaberete za unos će prvo proći kroz vaš filter."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:845
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "A common problem is to convert a list of comma-separated-values into a "
#| "QIF file. This is a textbook case for the awk tool. Create a script "
#| "called csv2qif.awk, with the following two lines as contents:"
msgid ""
"A common problem is to convert a list of comma-separated-values into a QIF "
"file. This is a textbook case for the <command>awk</command> tool. Create a "
"script called <filename>csv2qif.awk</filename>, with the following two lines "
"as contents:"
msgstr ""
"Uobičajeni problem je konvertovanje liste CSV u QIF datoteku. Ovo je školski "
"primjer za awk alat. Napravite skriptu nazvanu csv2qif.awk sa sljedeće dvije "
"linije kao sadržaj:"

#. Tag: programlisting
#: details-impexp.docbook:852
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"BEGIN { FS=&quot;,&quot;; print &quot;!Type:Bank&quot; }\n"
"\n"
"        { print &quot;D&quot;$1; print &quot;T&quot;$2; print &quot;N&quot;"
"$3; print &quot;P&quot;$4; print &quot;M&quot;$5; print &quot;^&quot; }"
msgstr ""
"BEGIN { FS=&quot;,&quot;; print &quot;!Type:Bank&quot; }\n"
"\n"
"        { print &quot;D&quot;$1; print &quot;T&quot;$2; print &quot;N&quot;"
"$3; print &quot;P&quot;$4; print &quot;M&quot;$5; print &quot;^&quot; }"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:854
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Then, change the QIF keys (D,T,N,P,M) to match the order of your csv "
#| "data. Set the input filter to <userinput>awk -f csv2qif.awk</userinput>."
msgid ""
"Then, change the QIF keys (D,T,N,P,M) to match the order of your CSV data. "
"Set the input filter to <userinput>awk -f csv2qif.awk</userinput>."
msgstr ""
"Zatim promijenite QIF ključeve (D,T,N,P,M) da odgovaraju redoslijedu vaših "
"csv podataka. Postavite filter unosa na <userinput>awk -f csv2qif.awk</"
"userinput>."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:859
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Another problem sometimes arises in the encoding of QIF files. &kappname; "
#| "expects files to be UTF8 encoded. If your file is encoded in something "
#| "else, it can be useful to convert it to UTF8. For example to convert it "
#| "from iso-8859-1, you would set the input filter to <userinput>recode "
#| "iso-8859-1..utf-8</userinput>."
msgid ""
"Another problem sometimes arises in the encoding of QIF files. &kmymoney; "
"expects files to be UTF8 encoded. If your file is encoded in something else, "
"it can be useful to convert it to UTF8. For example to convert it from "
"iso-8859-1, you would set the input filter to <userinput>recode iso-8859-1.."
"utf-8</userinput>."
msgstr ""
"Još jedan problem se nekad javlja u šifrovanju QIF datoteka. &kappname; "
"očekuje datotek da budu UTF8 šifrovane. Ako je vaša datoteka šifrovana na "
"neki drugi način, bili bi korisno da je konertujete u UTF8. Npr. da biste je "
"konvertali iz iso-8859-1, postavili biste filter unosa na <userinput>recode "
"iso-8859-1..utf-8</userinput>."

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:869
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Special &kappname; QIF extensions"
msgid "Special &kmymoney; QIF extensions"
msgstr "Specijalne &kappname; QIF ekstenzije"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:871
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "As already mentioned, one of the major drawbacks of the QIF format is the "
#| "lack of a unique identifier for each transaction. If you are writing your "
#| "own QIF file creator (or filter, as described above), you can overcome "
#| "this problem. &kappname; supports the '#' field. The importer will "
#| "interpret this as a unique transaction ID, and disregard the record if "
#| "the transaction is already in the system."
msgid ""
"As already mentioned, one of the major drawbacks of the QIF format is the "
"lack of a unique identifier for each transaction. If you are writing your "
"own QIF file creator (or filter, as described above), you can overcome this "
"problem. &kmymoney; supports the '#' field. The importer will interpret this "
"as a unique transaction ID, and disregard the record if the transaction is "
"already in the system."
msgstr ""
"Kao što je već pomenuto, jedna od velikih mana QIF formata je nedostatak "
"jedinstvenog identifikatora za svaku transakciju. Ukoliko sami pišete svoj "
"kreator QIF datoteka (ili filter, kao što je gore opisano), možete zaobići "
"ovaj problem. &kappname; podržava '#' polje. Importer će ovo prepoznati kao "
"jedinstveni ID transakcije, i zanemariće zapis ukoliko je transakcija već u "
"sistemu."

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:883
#, no-c-format
msgid "QIF Exporter"
msgstr "QIF izvoznik"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:884
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "To export one of your accounts to a QIF file, choose the "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenuitem>Export</guimenuitem> <guimenuitem>QIF</"
#| "guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the <guimenu>File</guimenu> menu. You will "
#| "be prompted for which single account to export, what file to export it "
#| "to, and what QIF Profile to use."
msgid ""
"To export one of your accounts to a QIF file, choose the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guisubmenu>Export</guisubmenu> "
"<guimenuitem>QIF...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu item. You will be "
"prompted for which single account to export, what file to export it to, and "
"which QIF Profile to use."
msgstr ""
"Da biste eksportovali jedan od računa u QIF datoteku, odaberite "
"<menuchoice><guimenuitem>Izvoz</guimenuitem> <guimenuitem>QIF</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> iz <guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> menija. Potom ćete biti upitani "
"koji račun želite eksportovati, u koju datoteku ga želite eksportovati i "
"koji QIF profil želite koristiti."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:892
#, no-c-format
msgid "At the moment, QIF Exporter does not handle export of investments."
msgstr "Trenutno QIF Eksporter ne podržava eksportovanje investicija."

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-impexp.docbook:903
#, no-c-format
msgid "QIF Export"
msgstr "QIF izvoz"

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:916
#, no-c-format
msgid "OFX Importer Plugin"
msgstr "OFX Importer dodatak"

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:919
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting the plugin"
msgstr "Kako doći do dodatka"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:921
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&kappname; will import OFX files painlessly. However, this functionality "
#| "is not built into the core program. You must obtain and install the OFX "
#| "Importer Plugin. Once that is installed, the command to import OFX files "
#| "will automatically show up under the <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu> "
#| "<guimenuitem>Import</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu."
msgid ""
"&kmymoney; will import OFX files painlessly. However, this functionality is "
"not built into the core program - it is provided as a Plugin. You must "
"obtain and install the OFX Importer Plugin for this functionality to be "
"available, Once that is done, the command to import OFX files will "
"automatically show up under the <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu> "
"<guisubmenu>Import</guisubmenu></menuchoice> submenu."
msgstr ""
"&kappname; će unijeti OFX datoteke bez problema. Ipak, ova funkcionalnost "
"nije ugrađena u samo jezgro programa. Morate dobaviti i instalirati OFX "
"Importer dodatak. Nakon što je instaliran, komanda za unos OFX datoteka će "
"automatski biti prikazana u <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Import</guimenuitem></menuchoice> meniju."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:930
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note that the source of the Plugin is provided as part of the &kmymoney; "
"source, and most prepackaged versions of &kmymoney; are built with the OFX "
"importer already included or available as a separate package. If the OFX "
"importer does not seem to be installed in your version, the first place to "
"check is in the same place you got your base &kmymoney; package. You can "
"check whether it is installed either by trying to invoke the above submenu, "
"or by invoking the <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu> "
"<guisubmenu>Configure KMyMoney...</guisubmenu></menuchoice> menu, selecting "
"<guilabel>Plugins</guilabel> in the left pane, and looking for the OFX "
"Importer in the list of installed Plugins."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:943
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you have installed from RPM, the OFX Importer Plugin is contained "
#| "within the kmymoney-ofx RPM. It should be available from whatever source "
#| "you got the base &kappname; RPM. If you have built from sources, all you "
#| "need to do is have preferably the libOFX 0.9 development headers and "
#| "libraries installed on your system. The &kappname; build process will "
#| "detect these and compile the plugin. At the time of release of &kappname; "
#| "4.6, the latest libofx version was 0.9.4, which is also the minimum "
#| "required version."
msgid ""
"If you have installed from RPM, the OFX Importer Plugin is contained within "
"the kmymoney-ofx package. It should be available from whatever source you "
"got the base &kmymoney; package. If you have built from sources, all you "
"need to do is have a recent version of the libOFX development headers and "
"libraries installed on your system. The &kmymoney; build process will detect "
"these and compile the plugin. As of September, 2021, version 0.10.3 was "
"avialable, although the minimum required version for &kmymoney; is still "
"0.9.4."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko ste ga instalirali iz RPM, OFX importer dodatak je sadržan unutar "
"kmymoney-ofx.RPM. Trebao bi biti dostupan sa bilo kojeg izvora koji imate sa "
"bazom &kappnae; RPM. Ukoliko ste pravili iz izvora, sve što trebate uraditi "
"je imati libOFX 0.9 razvojna zaglavlja i biblioteke instalirane na vašem "
"sistemu. &kappname; pokretački proces će ih prepoznati i kompajlirati "
"dodatak. U vremenu puštanja &kappname; verzije 4.6, najnovija verzija libofx "
"je bila 0.9.4, koja također predstavlja najstariju verziju potrebnu za "
"pokretanje."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:953
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Should you run into trouble trying to compile &kappname;, and you are "
#| "certain you have the correct version of libOFX installed, please contact "
#| "the developers list &devlist; for assistance. Include a copy of your "
#| "config.log file, compressed first via gzip."
msgid ""
"Should you run into trouble trying to compile &kmymoney;, and you are "
"certain you have the correct version of libOFX installed, please contact the "
"developers list &devlist; for assistance. Include a copy of your "
"<filename>config.log</filename> file, compressed first via <command>gzip</"
"command>."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko dođe do problema prilikom kompajliranja &kappname;, a sigurni ste "
"eda imate ispravnu verziju libOFX instaliranu, molimo vas da kontaktirate "
"developersku listu &devlist; za daljnje upute. Uključite kopiju vaše config."
"log datoteke, kompresovanu pomoću gzip."

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:962
#, no-c-format
msgid "What is OFX"
msgstr "Šta je OFX"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:964
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "OFX stands for <quote>Open Financial Exchange</quote>. According to the "
#| "<ulink url=\"http://www.ofx.net/\">OFX web site</ulink> <quote>Open "
#| "Financial Exchange (OFX) is a unified specification for the electronic "
#| "exchange of financial data between financial institutions, businesses and "
#| "consumers via the Internet. OFX is not a financial institution.</quote> "
#| "The specification defines formats for transfer of financial data both by "
#| "file and by direct interchange."
msgid ""
"OFX stands for <quote>Open Financial Exchange,</quote> although in 2019, the "
"OFX Consortium joined the <quote>Financial Data Exchange (FDX).</quote> "
"According to the <ulink url=\"https://finincialdataexchange.org/\">FDX web "
"site</ulink> <quote>Open Financial Exchange is an open standard for client-"
"server systems and cloud based APIs for exchanging financial data, and "
"performing financial transactions between financial institutions, and "
"financial applications.</quote> The specification defines formats for "
"transfer of financial data both by file and by direct interchange."
msgstr ""
"OFX predstavlja <quote>Open Financial Exchange</quote>(Otvorenu finansijsku "
"razmjenu). Prema <ulink url=\"http://www.ofx.net/\"> OFX internet stranici </"
"ulink> <quote>OFX je unificirana specifikacija za elektronsku razmjenu "
"finansijskih podataka između finansijskih institucija, preduzeća i potrošača "
"putem interneta. OFX nije finansijska institucija.</quote> Specifikacije "
"definišu formate za transfere finansijskih podataka pomoću datoteka i "
"direktnom razmjenom."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:975
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Although the standard is much more complete and robust than QIF, there "
#| "are still variations, depending on the specific implementation used by "
#| "any institution. OFX files may have an extension of <quote>OFX</quote> or "
#| "<quote>QFX</quote> (upper or lower case); this does not imply any "
#| "particular difference in the content. The specification is based on XML, "
#| "so the files can be read in any text editor, but as whitespace is not "
#| "relevant to the content itself, some implementations do not use any, "
#| "making it very hard for a human to read."
msgid ""
"Although the standard is much more complete and robust than QIF, there are "
"still variations, depending on the specific implementation used by any "
"institution. OFX files may have an extension of <quote>OFX</quote> or "
"<quote>QFX</quote> (upper or lower case); this does not imply any particular "
"difference in the content. The specification is based on &XML;, so the files "
"can be read in any text editor, but as whitespace is not relevant to the "
"content itself, some implementations do not use any, making it very hard for "
"a human to read."
msgstr ""
"Iako je standard mnogo kompletniji i robusniji nego QIF, ipak postoje "
"varijacije, u ovisnosti od određene implementacije od strane bilo koje "
"institucije. OFX datoteke mogu imati ekstenziju <quote>OFX</quote> ili "
"<quote>QFX</quote> (velika ili mala slova); ovo ne predstavlja nikakvu "
"specifičnu razliku u sadržaju. Specifikacija je bazirana na XML, kako bi "
"datoteke mogle biti očitane bilo kojim tekst editorom, ali pošto razmak ne "
"predstavlja značajan sadržaj, neke implementacije ga uopšte ne koriste, što "
"tekst čini teško čitljivim za čovjeka."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:986
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Another site with good information is <ulink url=\"http:/ofxhome.com/"
#| "\">OFX Home</ulink>. They maintain a directory of financial institutions "
#| "that support OFX. This can be useful if you have problems setting up "
#| "<link linkend=\"details.impexp.ofxdirectconnect\">OFX direct connect.</"
#| "link> They also have a forum for discussions about OFX issues."
msgid ""
"Another site with good information is <ulink url=\"https:/ofxhome.com/\">OFX "
"Home</ulink>. They maintain a directory of financial institutions that "
"support OFX. This can be useful if you have problems setting up <link "
"linkend=\"details.impexp.ofxdirectconnect\">OFX direct connect.</link> They "
"also have a forum for discussions about OFX issues. However, there is a post "
"on the site that it is expected to be closed down in February, 2022, if the "
"current maintainer does not find someone to replace him and take over "
"running the site."
msgstr ""
"Još jedna stranica sa dobrim informacijama je <ulink url=\"http:/ofxhome.com/"
"\">OFX Home</ulink>. Oni održavaju direktorij finansijskih institucija koje "
"podržavaju OFX. Ovo može biti korisno ukoliko imate problem prilikom "
"postavljanja <link linkend=\"details.impexp.ofxdirectconnect\">OFX direktne "
"konekcije.</link> Također posjeduju forum za diskusiju oko OFX problema."

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:999
#, no-c-format
msgid "Importing an OFX file"
msgstr "Unos OFX datoteke"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:1001
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The most basic way to import an OFX file is to choose the importer from "
#| "the menu bar. From the <guimenu>File</guimenu> menu, choose "
#| "<guimenuitem>Import</guimenuitem>, and then <guimenuitem>OFX...</"
#| "guimenuitem>. If OFX does not show up under Import, you do not have the "
#| "OFX Importer Plugin installed correctly. Please see the previous section."
msgid ""
"The most basic way to import an OFX file is to choose the importer from the "
"menu bar. From the <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guisubmenu>Import</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>OFX...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu item. If OFX "
"does not show up under Import, the OFX Importer Plugin is either not "
"installed or not installed installed correctly. Please see the previous "
"section."
msgstr ""
"Najjednostavniji način za unos OFX datoteke je da odaberete importet iz meni "
"bara. Iz <guimenu>Datoteka</guimenu> menija odaberite <guimenuitem>Uvoz</"
"guimenuitem> i potom <guimenuitem>OFX...</guimenuitem>. Ukoliko se OFX ne "
"pojavi pod Import(Unos), nemate ispravno instaliran OFX Importer dodatak. "
"Molimo vas pogledajte prethodnu sekciju."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:1009
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first thing the importer will do is ask you into which account to import "
"the transactions. If there are transactions from multiple accounts in your "
"file, you will be asked this question multiple times. Note that when "
"importing data for an investment account, purely cash transactions will be "
"imported to the associated brokerage account, if one is configured. If a "
"brokerage account has not been configured (or does not have the default "
"name) you may be asked to identify the account to use."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:1019
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After importing, some of your transactions may be shown with an exclamation "
"mark on a yellow triangle in the ledger. This is because they need to be "
"assigned a category. The importer was not able to automatically assign a "
"category based on your past transaction history. You can edit each "
"transaction in the ledger to assign a category, and the mark will be removed."
msgstr ""
"Nakon unosa, neke od vaših transakcija mogu biti prikazane sa uzvičnikom na "
"žutom trouglu unutar glavnoh pregleda. Do toga će doći ukoliko transakcija "
"mora biti dodijeljenja nekoj kategoriji. Importer nije bio u mogućnosti da "
"automatski dodijeli kategoriju na osnovu prijašnje historije transakcije. "
"Možete editovati bilo koju transakciju u glavnom pregledu kako biste joj "
"dodijelili kategoriju, i oznaka će biti uklonjena."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:1027
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Please note that this section describes the <quote>native</quote> OFX "
#| "importer. OFX files may also be imported using the AqBanking Importer "
#| "Plugin if you have installed that. Note that the two importers do behave "
#| "slightly differently, and they are written and supported by two different "
#| "developers."
msgid ""
"Please note that this section describes the <quote>native</quote> OFX "
"Importer Plugin. OFX files may also be imported using the AqBanking Importer "
"Plugin if you have installed that. The two importers do behave slightly "
"differently, and they are written and supported by different developers."
msgstr ""
"Molimo vas imajte na umu da ova sekcija opisuje <quote>native</quote> "
"(urođeni) OFX importer. OFX datoteke mogu također biti unesene pomoću "
"AqBanking Importer dodatka ukoliko imate taj instaliran. Imajte na umu da "
"dva importera imaju određenih razlika, i napisani su i podržani od strane "
"dva različita developera."

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:1036
#, no-c-format
msgid "Importing Investments"
msgstr "Unos investicija"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:1038
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Please note that if you are importing a file with investment "
#| "transactions, those investments must first exist in your &kappname; file. "
#| "The trading symbol is used to match, so please ensure that the symbol in "
#| "&kappname; is exactly the same as the one in the file you're importing."
msgid ""
"Please note that if you are importing a file with investment transactions, "
"those investments must first exist in your &kmymoney; file. The trading "
"symbol is used to match, so please ensure that the symbol in &kmymoney; is "
"exactly the same as the one in the file you're importing."
msgstr ""
"Imajte na umu da ukoliko unosite datoteku sa investicionim transakcijama, te "
"investicije moraju prvo postojati u vašoj &kappname; datoteci. Simbol "
"razmjene se koristi za povezivanje, zato molimo vas da osigurate da simol u "
"&kappname; bude isti kao i onaj u datoteci koju unosite."

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:1047
#, no-c-format
msgid "Web Connect"
msgstr "Internet povezivanje"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:1049
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The easiest way to import an OFX file is to set up Web Connect. Visit "
#| "your bank's web site, and click on a link to download an OFX file. Your "
#| "browser should ask you what program you would like to use to open the "
#| "file. Point your browser to &kappname;. It will then import the "
#| "downloaded OFX file into the &kappname; file you most recently had open. "
#| "You can also change the file associations of your desktop environment, "
#| "and have &kappname; open the OFX file automatically for you."
msgid ""
"The easiest way to import an OFX file is to set up Web Connect. Visit your "
"bank's web site, and click on a link to download an OFX file. Your browser "
"should ask you what program you would like to use to open the file. Point "
"your browser to &kmymoney;. It will then import the downloaded OFX file into "
"the &kmymoney; file currently open, or the one you most recently had open. "
"You can also change the file associations of your desktop environment, and "
"have &kmymoney; open the OFX file automatically for you."
msgstr ""
"Najlakši način da unesete OFX datoteku je da uspostavite internet "
"povezivanje. Posjetite internet stranicu svoje banke i kliknite na download "
"OFX datoteke. Vaš browser(pretraživač) bi vas trebao upitati koji program "
"želite koristiti da biste otvorili datoteku. Odaberite &kappname;. Tada će "
"downloadovana OFX datoteka biti unesena u &kappname; datoteku koju ste "
"zadnju otvarali. Također možete promijeniti udruženja datoteke vašeg desktop "
"okruženja kako bi &kappname; otvarao OFX datoteku automatski."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:1059
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you need to import the OFX file into some other &kappname; file, load "
#| "up that file in &kappname; first, and then visit your bank's web site."
msgid ""
"If you need to import the OFX file into some other &kmymoney; file, load up "
"that file in &kmymoney; first, and then visit your bank's web site."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko trebate unijeti OFX datotekuu neku drugu $kappname; datoteku, "
"otvorite tu datoteku u &kappname; prvo, a zatim posjetite internet stranicu "
"svoje banke."

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:1066
#, no-c-format
msgid "Direct Connect"
msgstr "Direktno povezivanje"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:1068
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"OFX Direct Connect is now supported in &kmymoney;. This gives &kmymoney; the "
"ability to contact your bank directly to obtain transaction. To enable this "
"feature, you must compile &kmymoney; with the <userinput><option>--enable-"
"ofxbanking</option></userinput> switch. This is now the default, and this "
"feature is enabled in the version provided by most if not all Linux "
"distributions, and the versions provided at the &kmymoney; website."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:1078
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Please be warned: Many banks require a separate signup, will give you a "
#| "separate password or PIN, and may even charge you a separate fee for this "
#| "service. No bank directly supports &kappname;. You will have to tell them "
#| "you want to bank directly from MS Money or Quicken."
msgid ""
"Please be warned: some banks require a different signup from the main web "
"banking access, will give you a separate password or PIN, and may even "
"charge you a separate fee for this service. No bank directly supports "
"&kmymoney;. You will have to tell them you want to bank directly from "
"<application>MS Money</application> or <application>Quicken</application>."
msgstr ""
"Molimo vas budite oprezni: Mnoge banke zahtijevaju odvojene prijave, daće "
"vam odvojenu šifru ili PIN i mogu vam čak i naplatiti korištenje ovih "
"usluga. Nijedna banka ne podržava direktno &kappname;. Morate im reći da "
"želite bankariti direktno pomoću MS Money ili Quicken."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:1086
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The first step is to configure each account for which you wish to "
#| "download statements. Go to the Accounts view, right click on the account "
#| "you wish to configure, and choose <guimenuitem>Map to online account...</"
#| "guimenuitem>. In case more than one online banking plugin is installed on "
#| "your system you will be asked which one to use. For the internal OFX "
#| "method select <guimenuitem>KMyMoney OFX</guimenuitem>. A list of banks "
#| "will be downloaded from the Internet and a wizard will guide you through "
#| "choosing a bank, entering your username and password, and selecting an "
#| "account. Should you find that your bank is not listed, then it may still "
#| "be possible to use the manual option. Your bank may be able to provide "
#| "the required parameters, or you may have to do some research to find them."
msgid ""
"The first step is to configure each account for which you wish to download "
"statements. Go to the Accounts View, right click on the account you wish to "
"configure, and choose <guimenuitem>Map to online account...</guimenuitem>. "
"In case more than one online banking plugin is installed on your system you "
"will be asked which one to use. For the internal OFX method select "
"<guimenuitem>&kmymoney; OFX</guimenuitem>. A list of banks will be "
"downloaded from the Internet and a wizard will guide you through choosing a "
"bank, entering your username and password, and selecting an account. Should "
"you find that your bank is not listed, it may still be possible to use the "
"manual option. Your bank may be able to provide the required parameters, or "
"you may have to do some research to find them."
msgstr ""
"Prvi korak je konfiguracija svakog računa za koji želite da downloadujete "
"izjave. Otiđite na pregled računa, desni klik na račun koji želite da "
"konfigurišete i odaberite <guimenuitem>Map to online account...</"
"guimenuitem>. U slučaju da je više od jednog dodatka internet bankarenja "
"instalirano na vašem sistemu, bićete upitani da odaberete jedan koji ćete "
"koristiti. Za internu OFX metodu odaberite <guimenuitem>KMyMoney OFX</"
"guimenuitem>. Lista banki će biti downloadovana sa interneta i čarobnjak će "
"vas voditi kroz odabir banke, unos korisničkog imena i šifre, te odabira "
"računa. Ukoliko primijetite da vaša banka nije u listi, onda je idalje "
"moguće da koristite opciju ručnog odabira. Vaša banka vam može dati sve "
"potrebne parametre, u suprotnom ih morate sami pronaći."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:1101
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Setting up OFX Direct Connect can sometimes be a challenge, especially as "
#| "the implementation at most institutions do not provide sufficient details "
#| "in error messages. One particular issue to note is that many institutions "
#| "require you to change your password the first time you access it online "
#| "using this method. Unfortunately, at this time, the library that "
#| "&kappname; uses (libofx) does not have a way to interactively change a "
#| "password. In some cases, it is possible to get a techincal support person "
#| "at the institution to change the password for you. Until we are able to "
#| "expand this section with more detailed troubleshooting information, if "
#| "you have trouble getting this to work for you, you can ask for help on "
#| "the &kappname; developer list &devlist;."
msgid ""
"Setting up OFX Direct Connect can sometimes be a challenge, especially as "
"the implementations at most institutions do not provide sufficient details "
"in error messages. One particular issue to note is that many institutions "
"require you to change your password the first time you access it online "
"using this method. Unfortunately, at this time, the library that &kmymoney; "
"uses (libofx) does not have a way to interactively change a password. In "
"some cases, it is possible to get a techincal support person at the "
"institution to change the password for you. Until we are able to expand this "
"section with more detailed troubleshooting information, if you have trouble "
"getting this to work for you, you can ask for help on the &kmymoney; "
"developer mailing list &devlist;."
msgstr ""
"Postavljanje OFX direktnog povezivanja može nekada biti izazovno, pogotovo "
"zato što implementacija u većini institucija ne pruža dovoljno detalja o "
"svim porukama o greškama. Jedan poseban problem koji treba imati na umu je "
"da mnoge institucija zahtijevaju da promijenite šifru nakon prvog online "
"pristupa koristeći ovu metodu. Nažalost, u ovom trenutku, biblioteka koju "
"&kappname; koristi (libofx) nema načina na koji interaktivno možete "
"promijeniti šifru. U nekim slučajevima, moguće je da dobijete tehničku "
"podršku osobe iz institucije kako bi ona promijenila šifru za vas. Dok ne "
"budemo u mogućnosti da proširimo ovu sekciju sa više detalja o informacijama "
"grešaka, ukoliko budete imali problema sa ovim, možete zatražiti pomoć na "
"&kappname; developer listi &devlist;."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:1116
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Once you have an account set up with online banking, go to the ledger for "
#| "that account. Then from the <guimenu>Account</guimenu> menu, choose "
#| "<guimenuitem>Update account...</guimenuitem>. This will connect to your "
#| "bank, and download a statement for the last 60 days."
msgid ""
"Once you have an account set up with online banking, go to the ledger for "
"that account, and then choose the <menuchoice><guimenu>Account</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Update account...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu item. "
"This will connect to your bank, and download available transactions. You can "
"use the <link linkend=\"details.accounts.edit\">Edit account</link> dialog "
"(under the <guilabel>Online settings</guilabel> tab, <guilabel>Import "
"Details</guilabel>subtab) to indicate whether to download transactions since "
"the last update, since a specified number of days ago, or since a specified "
"date."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što imate račun postavljen za online bankarstvo, otiđite u glavni "
"pregled za taj račun. Ztim iz <guimenu>Račun</guimenu> menija, odaberite "
"<guimenuitem>Ažuriraj račun...</guimenuitem>. Ovoće vas povezati sa vašom "
"bankom i preuzeti izvode za zadnjih 60 dana."

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:1130
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "In version of &kappname; prior to 4.6, the payee name was always taken "
#| "from the PAYEEID field. As of version 4.6, the payee name can be based on "
#| "either the PAYEEID, NAME, or MEMO field in the OFX transaction. You can "
#| "configure this feature and some other OFX direct connect settings by "
#| "selecting the appropriate tab in the <link linkend=\"details.accounts.edit"
#| "\">Edit account</link> dialog."
msgid ""
"In versions of &kmymoney; prior to 4.6, the payee name was always taken from "
"the <literal>PAYEEID</literal> field. As of version 4.6, the payee name can "
"be based on either the <literal>PAYEEID</literal>, <literal>NAME</literal>, "
"or <literal>MEMO</literal> field in the OFX transaction. You can configure "
"this feature and some other OFX direct connect settings in the "
"<guilabel>Edit account</guilabel> dialog mentioned just above."
msgstr ""
"U verziji &kappname; prethodno 4.6, ime osobe koja plaća je uzimani iz "
"PAYEEID polja. Od verzije 4.6, ime te osobe može biti bazirano na PAYEEID, "
"NAME ili MEMO polju u OFX transakciji. Možete konfigurisati ovo opciju kao i "
"neke druge OFX direktno povezivanje postavke odabirom odgovarajućeg taba u "
"<link linkend=\"details.accounts.edit\">Edit account</link> dijalogu."

#. Tag: title
#: details-impexp.docbook:1142
#, no-c-format
msgid "Exporting an OFX file"
msgstr "Eksportovanje OFX datoteke"

#. Tag: para
#: details-impexp.docbook:1144
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "It is not possible to export your data as an OFX file currently. If you "
#| "are interested to contribute in this area, please contact the libofx "
#| "development team for details."
msgid ""
"It is not currently possible to export your data as an OFX file. If you are "
"interested to contribute in this area, please contact the libofx development "
"team for details."
msgstr ""
"Trenutno nije omogućen izvoz podataka u vidu OFX datoteke. Ukoliko ste "
"zainteresovani da doprinesete u ovom poručju, molimo vas kontaktirajte "
"libofx razvojni tim za više detalja."

